						tabs: [{"paneId":"ctl00_ContentPlaceHolder1_ctl32_divTabs_0","title":"September 22, 2026 - Notice of Public Hearing or Meeting","content":"<p>NOTICE IS HEREBY GIVEN that the School Board of Polk County will hold a public meeting or hearing to which all persons are invited.&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Attendance Boundary Committee Meeting</strong></p>\n<p>Date/Time: <span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>September 22, 2026 at 5:30 P.M.&nbsp;<br>\n&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<br>\nLocation:&nbsp;<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>Jim Miles Professional Development Center<br>\n4270 Wallace Rd<br>\nLakeland, FL 33812&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Assistance: <span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>If you require any type of an accommodation because of a disability to participate in the public meeting or hearing, please call the Office of Compliance and ADA at (863) 534-0513.&nbsp; If you are deaf or hard of hearing, please contact us by calling the Florida Relay Service at 1-800-955-8771.&nbsp;<br>\n&nbsp;<br>\nAppeal Notice: <span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>Notice is given in accordance with § 286.0105, Florida Statutes, that a record is required to appeal any decision the School Board makes at a public meeting or hearing. Those making an appeal need to preserve a verbatim record of the proceeding at their own expense, usually with a court reporter. The record must include the essential testimony and evidence required for any such appeal.&nbsp;<br>\n<br>\nFor further information about this public meeting, please contact Facilities &amp; Operations for the School Board of Polk County, Florida, P.O. Box 391, Bartow, Florida 33831, at 863-534-0620 ext. 886.&nbsp;<br>\n&nbsp;<br>\nDated: September 14, 2026<br>\n<br>\nBy: Justin Sharpless, Board Chair&nbsp;<br>\nAttest: Frederick R. Heid, Secretary&nbsp;</p>","active":false,"disabled":false},{"paneId":"ctl00_ContentPlaceHolder1_ctl32_divTabs_1","title":"September 22, 2026 - Notice of Public Hearing or Meeting","content":"<p>NOTICE IS HEREBY GIVEN that the School Board of Polk County, Florida will hold a public meeting or hearing to which all persons are invited for the purpose of conducting regular business.<br>\n<br>\nDate/Time/Purpose:<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>August 25, 2026, 12:30 P.M. Work Session&nbsp;<br>\nAugust 25, 2026, 5:00 P.M. Board Meeting<br>\nSeptember 8, 2026 12:30 P.M. Work Session<br>\nSeptember 8, 2026 5:00 P.M. Board Meeting<br>\nSeptember 22, 2026 9:00 A.M. Work Session<br>\n<br>\nLocation:&nbsp;<span style=\"white-space: normal;\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>School Board Auditorium, 1915 S. Floral Avenue, Bartow, FL 33830</span></p>\n<p>Assistance:<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>If you require any type of an accommodation because of a disability to participate in the public meeting or hearing, please call the Office of Compliance and ADA at (863) 534-0513.&nbsp; If you are deaf or hard of hearing, please contact us by calling the Florida Relay Service at 1-800-955-8771.<br>\n<br>\nAppeal Notice:<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>Notice is given in accordance with § 286.0105, Florida Statutes, that a record is required to appeal any decision the School Board makes at a public meeting or hearing. Those making an appeal need to preserve a verbatim record of the proceeding at their own expense, usually with a court reporter. The record must include the essential testimony and evidence required for any such appeal.<br>\n<br>\nFor further information about this meeting, please contact the Superintendent’s Office of the School Board of Polk County, Florida, P.O. Box 391, Bartow, Florida 33831, at 863-534-0521.<br>\n<br>\nDated:&nbsp; August 7, 2026<br>\nBy: Justin Sharpless, Board Chair<br>\nAttest: Frederick R. Heid, Secretary</p>\n<div></div>","active":false,"disabled":false},{"paneId":"ctl00_ContentPlaceHolder1_ctl32_divTabs_2","title":"September 15 , 2026 - Notice of Public Hearing or Meeting","content":"<p>Notice is hereby given that the School Board of Polk County, Florida will hold a public meeting to which all persons are invited.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Sales Tax Oversight Committee Meeting</strong></p>\n<p>Date/Time: September 15 , 2026, at 5:00 P.M.<br>\n<br>\nDiscussion: Half Penny Sales Tax Oversight<br>\n<br>\nLocation:&nbsp;Polk County School District Office Facilities Conference Room 1915 South Floral Avenue, Bartow, FL 33830<br>\n<br>\nAssistance:&nbsp;If you require any type of accommodation because of a disability to participate in the public meeting or hearing, please call the Office of Compliance and ADA at 863-534-0513.&nbsp; If you are deaf or hard of hearing, please contact us by calling the Florida Relay Service at 1-800-955-8771.</p>\n<p>Appeal Notice: Notice is given with accordance with § 286.0105, Florida Statutes, that a record is required to appeal any decision the School Board makes at a public meeting or hearing.&nbsp; Those making an appeal need to preserve a verbatim record of the proceedings at their own expense, usually with a court reporter.&nbsp; The record must include the essential testimony and evidence required for any such appeal.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>\n<br>\nFor further information about this public meeting, please contact Joshua McLemore, Director, Facilities Planning for the School Board of Polk County, Florida, P.O. Box 391, Bartow, Florida 33831, at 863-534-0620, ext. 489.<br>\n<br>\nDated:&nbsp; August 31, 2026</p>\n<br>","active":false,"disabled":false},{"paneId":"ctl00_ContentPlaceHolder1_ctl32_divTabs_3","title":"September 8, 2026 - Notice of Public Hearing or Meeting","content":"<p>NOTICE IS HEREBY GIVEN that the School Board of Polk County, Florida will hold a public meeting or hearing to which all persons are invited for the purpose of conducting regular business.<br>\n<br>\nDate/Time/Purpose:<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>August 25, 2026, 12:30 P.M. Work Session&nbsp;<br>\nAugust 25, 2026, 5:00 P.M. Board Meeting<br>\nSeptember 8, 2026 12:30 P.M. Work Session<br>\nSeptember 8, 2026 5:00 P.M. Board Meeting<br>\nSeptember 22, 2026 9:00 A.M. Work Session<br>\n<br>\nLocation:&nbsp;<span style=\"white-space: normal;\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>School Board Auditorium, 1915 S. Floral Avenue, Bartow, FL 33830</span></p>\n<p>Assistance:<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>If you require any type of an accommodation because of a disability to participate in the public meeting or hearing, please call the Office of Compliance and ADA at (863) 534-0513.&nbsp; If you are deaf or hard of hearing, please contact us by calling the Florida Relay Service at 1-800-955-8771.<br>\n<br>\nAppeal Notice:<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>Notice is given in accordance with § 286.0105, Florida Statutes, that a record is required to appeal any decision the School Board makes at a public meeting or hearing. Those making an appeal need to preserve a verbatim record of the proceeding at their own expense, usually with a court reporter. The record must include the essential testimony and evidence required for any such appeal.<br>\n<br>\nFor further information about this meeting, please contact the Superintendent’s Office of the School Board of Polk County, Florida, P.O. Box 391, Bartow, Florida 33831, at 863-534-0521.<br>\n<br>\nDated:&nbsp; August 7, 2026<br>\nBy: Justin Sharpless, Board Chair<br>\nAttest: Frederick R. Heid, Secretary</p>\n<div></div>","active":false,"disabled":false},{"paneId":"ctl00_ContentPlaceHolder1_ctl32_divTabs_4","title":"September 8, 2026 - Notice of Public Hearing","content":"<p>NOTICE IS HEREBY GIVEN that the School Board of Polk County will hold a public hearing or meeting to which all persons are invited.</p>\n<p>Date/Time/Purpose:&nbsp; <span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>September 8, 2026, to begin no earlier than 5:00 P.M.<br>\n<span style=\"white-space: normal; white-space:pre\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"white-space: normal;\">The public hearing is for the following policy updates:</span></p>\n<p>Policy 5722- School-Sponsored Publications and Productions<br>\n<br>\nLocation:&nbsp;<span style=\"white-space: normal;\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>School Board Auditorium, 1915 South Floral Avenue, Bartow, FL 33830</span></p>\n<p>Assistance:<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>If you require any type of an accommodation because of a disability to participate in the public meeting or hearing, please call the Office of Compliance and ADA at (863) 534-0513.&nbsp; If you are deaf or hard of hearing, please contact us by calling the Florida Relay Service at 1-800-955-8771.<br>\n<br>\nAppeal Notice:<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>Notice is given in accordance with § 286.0105, Florida Statutes, that a record is required to appeal any decision the School Board makes at a public meeting or hearing.&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Those making an appeal need to preserve a verbatim record of the proceeding at their own expense, usually with a court reporter. The record must include the essential testimony and evidence required for any such appeal.</span></p>\n<p>For further information about this meeting, please contact Teresa Griffin, Assistant Director - Policy and Public Records, Office of Superintendent of the School Board of Polk County, Florida P.O. Box 391, Bartow, Florida 33831, at 863-578-8208.</p>\n<p>Dated: August 7, 2026&nbsp;</p>\n<p>By: Justin Sharpless, Board Chair<br>\n&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t\t</span>Attest: Frederick R. Heid, Secretary</p>\n<div></div>","active":false,"disabled":false},{"paneId":"ctl00_ContentPlaceHolder1_ctl32_divTabs_5","title":"September 8, 2026 - Notice of Public Hearing or Meeting","content":"<p><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px; font-size: 13.3333px; font-size: 13.3333px;\">NOTICE IS HEREBY GIVEN that the School Board of Polk County will hold a public meeting or hearing to which all persons are invited.&nbsp;<br>\n<br>\n&nbsp;<br>\nDate/Time/Purpose: <span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>September 8, 2026, to begin no earlier than 5:01 P.M.<br>\nAdopt Final Budget for the fiscal year 2026-2027.<br>\n&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<br>\nLocation:&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>School Board Auditorium 1915 South Floral Avenue Bartow, FL 33830<br>\n</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px; font-size: 13.3333px; font-size: 13.3333px;\">Assistance: <span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>If you require any type of an accommodation because of a disability to participate in the public meeting or hearing, please call the Office of Compliance and ADA at (863) 534-0513.&nbsp; If you are deaf or hard of hearing, please contact us by calling the Florida Relay Service at 1-800-955-8771.&nbsp;<br>\n&nbsp;<br>\nAppeal Notice: <span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>Notice is given in accordance with § 286.0105, Florida Statutes, that a record is required to appeal any decision the School Board makes at a public meeting or hearing. Those making an appeal need to preserve a verbatim record of the proceeding at their own expense, usually with a court reporter. The record must include the essential testimony and evidence required for any such appeal.&nbsp;<br>\n&nbsp;<br>\nFor further information about this public meeting, please contact James Fout, Acting Associate Superintendent - Chief Financial Officer, School Board of Polk County, Florida, P.O. Box 391, Bartow, Florida 33831, at 863-457-4704.&nbsp;<br>\n&nbsp;<br>\nDated: August 7, 2026&nbsp;<br>\nBy: Dr. Justin Sharpless, Board Chair&nbsp;<br>\n<br>\nAttest: Frederick R. Heid, Secretary&nbsp;<br>\n</span></p>\n<div></div>","active":false,"disabled":false}],// required,
						propPaneId: 'paneId', // optional - pass in default value for demo purposes
						propTitle: 'title', // optional - pass in default value for demo purposes
